{{also|whitecollar|white collar}}
==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|whitecollar|white collar}}

===Etymology===
From the colour of dress shirts worn by professional and clerical workers, as opposed to the rugged denim and chambray shirts normally worn by manual workers.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-PerfectSoundWhatever-white-collar.wav|a=CA}}

